        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether a district court\u2019s dismissal of an FTCA claim for failure of proof triggers the judgment bar, or whether that is merely a jurisdictional determination."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "JUSTICE BARRETT",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c885f4756b56460eac53d19ff3637bc994e9a8ad34f90eb8ee1d9a4eb8fec078",
