              "start": 61
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to JUSTICE BARRETT, justice Barrett inquired whether a summary judgment, as requested by the government, would invoke the judgment bar."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Chief Justice Roberts",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c885f4756b56460eac53d19ff3637bc994e9a8ad34f90eb8ee1d9a4eb8fec078",
