            "pages": {
              "end": 5,
              "start": 5
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The decision clarifies that a judgment under the FTCA bars not only further FTCA claims but also other federal\u2011law claims, such as Bivens actions, arising from the same facts."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c885f4756b56460eac53d19ff3637bc994e9a8ad34f90eb8ee1d9a4eb8fec078",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c885f4756b56-0001-0001"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "c885f4756b56460eac53d19ff3637bc994e9a8ad34f90eb8ee1d9a4eb8fec078",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c885f4756b56-0003-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 68,
              "start": 68
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The ruling reinforces Congress\u2019s intent that the judgment bar provide finality (\u201crepose\u201d) to the entire controversy, limiting litigants from relitigating the same injuries in separate federal claims."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "c885f4756b56460eac53d19ff3637bc994e9a8ad34f90eb8ee1d9a4eb8fec078",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c885f4756b56-0003-0003"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 66,
              "start": 66
            }
          },
          {
            "document_hash": "c885f4756b56460eac53d19ff3637bc994e9a8ad34f90eb8ee1d9a4eb8fec078",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-c885f4756b56-0002-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 61,
              "start": 61
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The case signals to lower courts that summary judgments or dismissals in FTCA actions can have preclusive effect on related claims, affecting litigation strategy."
      }
    ],
